# Agent Foreman Environment Configuration
# Copy this file to .env and adjust values as needed.

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# AGENT CONFIGURATION
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Configure which AI agents to use and their priority order
# - Order determines priority: first agent is tried first
# - Only listed agents are enabled (others are ignored even if installed)
# - Valid agent names: claude, codex, gemini, opencode
# - Default: claude,codex,gemini,opencode
#
# Examples:
#   AGENT_FOREMAN_AGENTS=claude              # Only use Claude
#   AGENT_FOREMAN_AGENTS=codex,gemini        # Prefer Codex, Gemini as fallback
#   AGENT_FOREMAN_AGENTS=claude,codex,gemini,opencode # Default order (explicit)
#
# AGENT_FOREMAN_AGENTS=claude,codex,gemini,opencode

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OpenCode Configuration (Optional)
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Set specific model for OpenCode agent (overrides OpenCode CLI default)
# OPENCODE_MODEL=google-vertex/gemini-1.5-pro-002
#
# Set specific sub-agent for OpenCode (default: none)
# OPENCODE_AGENT=summary

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Timeout Configuration (milliseconds)
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Most AI operations have no timeout by default (wait until completion).
# Override here if you need hard limits.
#
# AGENT_FOREMAN_TIMEOUT_SCAN=900000        # AI project scan (default: ∞)
# AGENT_FOREMAN_TIMEOUT_VERIFY=600000      # AI verification (default: ∞)
# AGENT_FOREMAN_TIMEOUT_CAPABILITY=300000  # AI capability discovery (default: ∞)
# AGENT_FOREMAN_TIMEOUT_DEFAULT=300000     # Fallback timeout (default: ∞)